<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 21:23:31 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>40 万亿美元的国家债务不断增长，而社会保障却破产了——因为富裕的婴儿潮一代每年领取超过 10 万美元的福利</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/40-trillion-debt-social-security-boomers-100k-benefits/</link><description>婴儿潮一代从社会保障中获得了 265% 的回报，而“巨大的财富转移”并不能拯救 Z 世代。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1444415096-e1787860668809.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 19:58:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/40-trillion-debt-social-security-boomers-100k-benefits/</guid></item><item><title>一位曾经反对“亿万富翁男孩俱乐部”的顾问现在正在带头反对加州的财富税</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/california-billionaire-tax-prop-40/</link><description>内德·威格尔斯沃思（Ned Wigglesworth）曾批评大捐助者收买影响力。如今，他正在帮助领导一场针对 40 号提案的九位数竞选活动&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290610338-e1787859664918.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 19:38:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/california-billionaire-tax-prop-40/</guid></item><item><title>在边境州，就连特朗普自己的政党也希望加拿大之战结束</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/tariff-canada-reaction-maine-michigan-vermont/</link><description>缅因州、佛蒙特州和密歇根州的州长、参议员和汽车制造商花了 18 个月的时间警告白宫，与加拿大的贸易战将会产生影响。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289921630-e1787857910806.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 19:39:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/tariff-canada-reaction-maine-michigan-vermont/</guid></item><item><title>比特币这个月表现不错，但随着比特币飙升至 100 美元以上，Solana 的表现甚至更好</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/bitcoin-great-month-solana-soars-above-100/</link><description>除了比特币的卷土重来之外，投资者还找到了购买 Solana 的新理由。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1370827731-e1787856311287.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 18:49:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/bitcoin-great-month-solana-soars-above-100/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 首次进军物理人工智能领域，为科学家和制造商提供将设备变为现实的新方法</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/anthropic-makes-first-move-into-physical-ai-with-universal-standard-for-scientists-manufacturing/</link><description>模型硬件标准 (MHS) 适用于任何 AI 模型，而不仅仅是 Claude，但目前只有少数公司可以访问研究预览。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1401717766-e1787851026926.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/anthropic-makes-first-move-into-physical-ai-with-universal-standard-for-scientists-manufacturing/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 禁止亲俄罗斯的 ChatGPT 帐户用于传播亲克里姆林宫的内容，包括使用真实研究人员姓名的以色列智囊团</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/openai-bans-cluster-russian-chatgpt-users-burke-institute-influence-campaign-cybersecurity/</link><description>OpenAI 声称，俄罗斯用户隐藏在 VPN 后面，推动与影响力行动相关的智库并在网上传播亲俄罗斯内容。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290946167-e1787852235645.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 17:54:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/openai-bans-cluster-russian-chatgpt-users-burke-institute-influence-campaign-cybersecurity/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能奥德赛：新技术如何唤醒古希腊世界的原始恐惧</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/ai-oyssey-cognitive-offload-fear-imposter-syndrome-psychology/</link><description>早在聊天机器人出现之前，希腊人就围绕着 2026 年的焦虑建立了一套完整的哲学。我们都是奥德修斯，在海妖的召唤中航行。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288829036-e1787849980426.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 17:29:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/ai-oyssey-cognitive-offload-fear-imposter-syndrome-psychology/</guid></item><item><title>“显然，人们讨厌数据中心”：萨姆·奥尔特曼承认美国人讨厌他所做的事情，因为他自己的数据中心负责人辞职了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/sam-altman-openai-data-center-backlash/</link><description>尽管 OpenAI 在美国各地增加了数千兆瓦项目，但十分之七的美国人反对在他们附近建立人工智能数据中心&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287517468-e1787850440167.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 17:27:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/sam-altman-openai-data-center-backlash/</guid></item><item><title>我们解雇了他。然后我们又雇用了他</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/we-laid-him-off-then-we-hired-him-back/</link><description>当我们重新聘用 Syndio 的 Jonathan 时，他重新登录，发现我们冰冷的公司重组公告仍在他的收件箱中。肠拳。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/maria-e1787842979454.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 15:06:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/we-laid-him-off-then-we-hired-him-back/</guid></item><item><title>中国开源人工智能开始赢得美国企业的青睐</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/chinese-open-source-ai-is-starting-to-win-over-u-s-businesses/</link><description>新的支出数据表明，企业越来越多地转向更便宜、可定制的开放模式，包括来自中国的快速改进的系统。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2286500319-e1787844024333.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 16:09:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/27/chinese-open-source-ai-is-starting-to-win-over-u-s-businesses/</guid></item></channel></rss>